{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_003_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c52450c46309346075970e448b33ea806c2df6f8860e4fcd89cd8ddee04f7f52",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b5ab1ce0f73e8a443a1fa21aff2de7d2bd49dbc9d7b49fe2fb83f83c2b6a771",
      "text": "东京都内某处……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fa06ef8e523eef1902eeabc9d54bdae1f00f616e048bbe387883b118f68f54c",
      "text": "北斗君，今天谢谢你。\n是最棒的约会呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36ea1111a48b6592391e46b86418d6e037511e0a56c3d8d7c76e8650232cad93",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢你。\n我也度过了一段美好的时光。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:821417954e119c67b0abef94f1a1cdc25b2a8b4b99cb8937227ac1b499c92e2b",
      "text": "真的吗？呐，2月14日是你的生日吧。\n不介意的话要不要一起吃个晚饭？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd3e22d699bc67de58ca8e66f46e88b77fb058af9fd702872d664b00836df654",
      "text": "真是诱人的邀请呢。\n但是很抱歉，那天我已经有约了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c09cb92a82576eb6b4438e43a77a1990beffbe90f3788098d303b18b097dfdc",
      "text": "这样啊，\n北斗君果然很受欢迎呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47e4649e5e50117eeefd1569f29514555ca93f9896f4c1a34a4ac12de9e87c9e",
      "text": "我一定会补偿你的。\n请期待我们因未能相见而积攒的时光吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2237aadff9d785d0c6f9f08828a6a79763973ee88d36f8f70c73b181513b8458",
      "text": "真是的，说好了哦。\n不过真嫉妒能陪你一起过生日的人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2be11f07f3d0249afb98ec5f141b6f0668315662edab8f3c47f776cbd7b8c948",
      "text": "呵呵，下次我会给你一个无比精彩的约会，\n让你把这可爱的醋意都忘得一干二净。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e3af6b24bd100b8f7b5658e299de17124ff88d3d5bb9ba3f61cb392cb394198",
      "text": "（不过，那个所谓的先约\n可不是和天使酱的约会呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
